      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "What kind of festival is it? \nYou present sweet treats\nwith passionate feelings for someone you like,\nor with gratitude for someone \nwho has taken care of you.",
        "Jp" : "どんなお祭りかって？\n好意を寄せている人へのアツい想いや\nお世話になっている人への感謝を込めて\n甘いお菓子をプレゼントするの"
